    {
      "@id": "concept:health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019-sch-1-sec-132f",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "132F Data-matching principles",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019#sch-1-sec-132f"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, make principles in\nrelation to the matching of information under subsection 132B(1)\nby:\n\n(a) the Chief Executive Medicare; and\n\n(b) an authorised Commonwealth entity.\n\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the principles must:\n\n(a) require the Chief Executive Medicare to establish and\nmaintain a publicly available register of the kinds of\ninformation matched by the Chief Executive Medicare or an\nauthorised Commonwealth entity under subsection 132B(1);\nand\n\nSchedule 1  Data-matching",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister must, by legislative instrument, make principles in\nrelation to the matching of information under subsection 132B(1)\nby:\n\n(a) the Chief Executive Medicare; and\n\n(b) an authorised Commonwealth entity.\n\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the principles must:\n\n(a) require the Chief Executive Medicare to establish and\nmaintain a publicly available register of the kinds of\ninformation matched by the Chief Executive Medicare or an\nauthorised Commonwealth entity under subsection 132B(1);\nand\n\nSchedule 1  Data-matching",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019-sch-1-sec-132f-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019-sch-1-sec-132f-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f73827388e2b3b7667ac0784e366d90de58e4d4784f1b5313f5cb7d05fad4aa9"
