      },
      "dc:source": "health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\nData-matching  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 121, 2019\nHealth Legislation Amendment (Data-matching and Other Matters) Act\n\n(5C) Nothing in this section, or in the rules issued by the Information\nCommissioner, precludes the matching of information under\nsubsection 132B(1) or the operation of Part VIIIA generally.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\nData-matching  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 121, 2019\nHealth Legislation Amendment (Data-matching and Other Matters) Act\n\n(5C) Nothing in this section, or in the rules issued by the Information\nCommissioner, precludes the matching of information under\nsubsection 132B(1) or the operation of Part VIIIA generally.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019-sch-1-sec-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7eaa879ddb9e0d5c30fac8192d59d5906dede4a67a1bcbc662b9590d964a6e07",
      "skos:note": "No data-matching is prohibited under this section."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019#sch-1-sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 After subsection 135AA(5B)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\nData-matching  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 121, 2019\nHealth Legislation Amendment (Data-matching and Other Matters) Act\n\n(5C) Nothing in this section, or in the rules issued by the Information\nCommissioner, precludes the matching of information under\nsubsection 132B(1) or the operation of Part VIIIA generally."
    },
