      "dc:source": "health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "commencement\nSection 132B of the National Health Act 1953, as inserted by this Part,\napplies in relation to information collected, accessed or obtained before,\non or after the commencement of this item.\n\nSchedule 1  Data-matching",
      "skos:definition": "commencement\nSection 132B of the National Health Act 1953, as inserted by this Part,\napplies in relation to information collected, accessed or obtained before,\non or after the commencement of this item.\n\nSchedule 1  Data-matching",
