      "dc:source": "health-legislation-amendment-data-matching-and-other-matters-act-2019.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nNote:\nA disclosure in accordance with subsection 132D(1) of the National\nHealth Act 1953 is also taken to be an authorised disclosure for the\npurposes of this section: see subsection 132D(3) of the National\nHealth Act 1953.\n\nSchedule 1  Data-matching",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\nNote:\nA disclosure in accordance with subsection 132D(1) of the National\nHealth Act 1953 is also taken to be an authorised disclosure for the\npurposes of this section: see subsection 132D(3) of the National\nHealth Act 1953.\n\nSchedule 1  Data-matching",
