      "values:originalText": "After “initiating services”, insert “(other than a service of a kind\nreferred to in paragraph (c) of the definition of service in\nsubsection 81(1))”.\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments",
      "skos:definition": "After “initiating services”, insert “(other than a service of a kind\nreferred to in paragraph (c) of the definition of service in\nsubsection 81(1))”.\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
